"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s ","type":"text"},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/underline(_:pattern:color:)":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/underline(_:pattern:color:)","title":"underline(_:pattern:color:)","role":"symbol","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"underline","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"pattern","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Text","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4TextV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"LineStyle","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4TextV9LineStyleV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Pattern","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4TextV9LineStyleV7PatternV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"color","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Color","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s: